---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" data-animate data-animate-delay="2">
  <SectionHeading title="About" />
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
    I'm a final-year CS student at NTU (GPA 3.98/4.3) working on high-performance and
    LLM-inference systems such as quantization, kernel fusion, distributed training/inference, and
    diffusion-model decoding. My research and competition work has taken me from a 777x speedup
    on an exascale climate emulator to an overall win at the SC25 Student Cluster Competition. I'm
    applying to MSCS programs to keep pushing on the systems side of AI.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Since Sep 2024, I've been an undergraduate researcher in ElsaLab under Prof. Chun-Yi Lee at
    NTU CSIE, where most of my systems and ML-inference research takes shape before it turns into
    competition results or papers.
  </p>
</section>
